---
description: Prefer the user as QA; ask before spending time verifying yourself
alwaysApply: true
---

# User is the QA

Do not spend a long time verifying, synthesizing fixtures, uploading test files, or clicking through the app unless the user asked for that.

After implementing, say what changed and what is worth checking. Ask whether they want you to QA it or they will. If they will, stop there.

Typecheck or a quick sanity check is fine when it is cheap. Skip elaborate end-to-end verification, generated audio, curl scripts, and browser walkthroughs unless they opt in.
